OL,3,AMan arrested after sexual assaults at
OL,4,Auniversity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 29-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter seven women reported being
OL,8,Fsexually assaulted in and around the
OL,9,FUniversity of Huddersfield's grounds.
OL,11,FWest Yorkshire Police said it attended
OL,12,Fthe university on Tuesday evening after
OL,13,Fbeing called by its security office and
OL,14,Festablished all of the incidents
OL,15,Fhappened between 18:00 and 18:30 GMT.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for the force said the
OL,18,Fwomen "had made off from a suspect
OL,19,Fafter he approached and grabbed at
OL,20,Fthem", with the held man remaining in
OL,21,Fpolice custody on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
